msgid "Example with sessions, without noise:\n"
msgstr "Halimbawa na may mga session, walang noise:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate with noise, specify a QPU (quantum hardware) and submit it to Aer.  Aer builds a noise model based on the calibration data from that QPU, and instantiates an Aer backend with that model.  If you prefer, you can [build a noise model](/guides/build-noise-models).\n"
msgstr "Para mag-simulate na may noise, tukuyin ang isang QPU (quantum hardware) at isumite ito sa Aer. Nagtatayo ang Aer ng noise model batay sa calibration data mula sa QPU na iyon, at nag-i-instantiate ng Aer backend na may modelong iyon. Kung gusto mo, maaari kang [gumawa ng noise model](/guides/build-noise-models).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"A QPU can be affected by different kinds of noise. The Qiskit Aer noise model used here only simulates some of them and therefore is likely to be less severe than the noise on a real QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Ang isang QPU ay maaaring maapektuhan ng iba't ibang uri ng noise. Ang Qiskit Aer noise model na ginagamit dito ay nag-si-simulate lamang ng ilan sa mga ito at samakatuwid ay malamang na hindi kasing grabe ng noise sa isang tunay na QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For details on what errors are included when initializing a noise model from a QPU, see the Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mga detalye kung aling mga error ang kasama kapag nagsi-initialize ng noise model mula sa isang QPU, tingnan ang Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

